</style></div><main class="main-wrapper"><header class="section_header no-bottom-border"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="max-width-large"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium"><h1>How to List</h1></div><div class="margin-bottom margin-large _3-5"><div class="max-width-medium"><div class="text-size-large">The application process to join the Long-Term Stock Exchange is confidential, and straightforward. We’re here to provide information, guidance, and support at every step.</div></div></div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-group"><a data-wf-native-id-path="2bbefab5-a4c6-49d9-fb02-e1841cb207f0" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2bbefab5-a4c6-49d9-fb02-e1841cb207f0" href="/contact-listings" class="button w-button">Connect with an Advisor</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div class="section background-color-grey bordered"><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="padding-global nullify-mobile"><div class="container-large"><div class="grid-4col"><div id="w-node-_542788ea-1f6f-799b-1939-d26efe80b612-0d03572e" class="grid-cell is-first is-aligned-top is-bordered gap-16 centered"><div class="heading-eyebrow text-size-medium">Step 1</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6663093a36cf22a34ff7a206_Group%2010128961.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-1x1-xxlarge-2 is-120"/><h5>Draft long-term policies</h5></div><div id="w-node-_80d43173-c8ef-cbee-dcf4-5ee124be9ee0-0d03572e" class="grid-cell gap-16 is-aligned-top is-bordered centered"><div class="heading-eyebrow text-size-medium">Step 2</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/66630979bd808cc35a1aeedc_Group%2010128963.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-1x1-xxlarge-2 is-120"/><h5>Submit preliminary application</h5></div><div id="w-node-c7cf2d46-9b3a-0795-fde7-2736e4b074d4-0d03572e" class="grid-cell is-bordered is-aligned-top gap-16 centered"><div class="heading-eyebrow text-size-medium">Step 3</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/6655fe1b2bd82fe37f449437_Group%2010128961.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-1x1-xxlarge-2 is-120"/><h5>Your board approves long-term policies</h5></div><div id="w-node-_279b52bf-c4e8-3258-af7e-b96318f498e9-0d03572e" class="grid-cell is-aligned-top is-bordered gap-16 centered no-bottom"><div class="heading-eyebrow text-size-medium">Step 4</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/66630979751fd54f7804a4a5_Group%2010128964.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-1x1-xxlarge-2 is-120"/><h5>Submit final listings application</h5></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="section padding-section-medium bordered-bottom"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="flex-horizontal is-case-study-testimonial"><div class="flex-vertical align-left gap-32 is-770-w"><h3>Dual listing is easier than expected</h3><div class="margin-top margin-small"><div class="text-size-large padding-top"><strong>“It was not and has not been a separate lift for our department. Itʼs not a lot of overhead. </strong>What we wanted to do was align ourselves — our employees, our policies, and our investors – with our long-term goals. This was another way to understand who our long-term investors were and to be able to focus on those long-term.ˮ*</div></div><div>*Understanding LTSE Listings, The Corporate Counsel Webcast, December 8, 2021</div></div><div class="case-study-testimonial-right max-width"><div class="flex-vertical gap-50 testimonial centered"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6462417e8db99f8baa069524/664f69fff1a92b31ca7797fa_Group%2010128892.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Smiling blonde woman with long hair wearing a black top against a teal and green background." class="testimonial-200"/><div class="text-size-large"><strong>— Eleanor Lacey</strong>, <br/>Asana Head of Legal and <br/>General Counsel</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large"><div class="margin-bottom margin-medium _2rem"><div class="heading-eyebrow"> </div></div><h2 class="heading-xlarge-h1">Listing application forms</h2></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-bottom padding-section-large"><div class="accordian_wrapper"><div data-w-id="3ccec949-704b-55b1-7b02-f9f48facb814" class="accordian_title"><h3>1. Standards and policies</h3><div class="rl_faq1_icon-wrapper"><div class="rl_faq1_icon w-embed"><svg width=" 100%" height=" 100%" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
